</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>What else could I desire</l><l>In heaven or on earth?</l><l>To this alone I would aspire:</l><l>To know Thy peerless worth.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thou art my heart’s delight,</l><l>The Sweetest of the sweet;</l><l>All else becomes devoid of taste</l><l>When once compared to Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, on account of Thee</l><l>All other loves grow pale;</l><l>Chiefest among ten thousand, Thou</l><l>Dost e’er o’er all prevail.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Enamored of Thyself</l><l>I forfeit all to Thee,</l><l>For ’tis when I have nothing that</l><l>I’ve everything in Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
